      <description>&lt;p&gt;We were at AIM26 this year and had a great time meeting physics students and introducing the ASGARD group :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;AIM (Working Group Inspiration Fair)&lt;/strong&gt; is an annual information fair organized by the Fachschaft, aimed at connecting physics students with research groups. Its primary purpose is to provide students with the opportunity to speak directly with researchers in order to find opportunities for &lt;strong&gt;Bachelor&amp;rsquo;s or Master&amp;rsquo;s theses&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;student research assistant positions (HiWi jobs)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks to everyone who helped make our participation possible! Special thanks go to Ole and Benedikt for representing the group at the stand :)&lt;/p&gt;
